{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411230","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1341123001:1":{"text":"치피, 왜 그렇게 신기한 눈으로 내 무기를 보고 있는 거지?","source_cn":"满满，你为什么用这么奇怪的眼神看着我的武器？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x138816FA14A7BCF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341123002:1":{"text":"기사 대검이 정말 예뻐서요! 그리고 갑옷도... 예쁘고 실용적이잖아요! 기사에게는 정말 최고의 장비네요!","source_cn":"你的骑士大剑可真漂亮！还有你的板甲……又精美又实用，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50C4C420C238137A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341123003:1":{"text":"물론이지. 무기는 기사가 가장 믿을 수 있는 동료이자 기사로서의 명예와 자존심의 상징이야.","source_cn":"那当然，它们是一位骑士最能信赖的伙伴，也是骑士的尊严和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BF672E706746B31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341123004:1":{"text":"맞아요! 무슨 일이 있어도 치피는 검과 갑옷을 버리지 않을 거예요. 바다에 빠지더라도요!","source_cn":"对呀对呀！无论如何，满满都不会抛弃剑和胸甲，就算是掉进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF71D6C055437560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341123005:1":{"text":"예전에 스토미 해협에서 난파를 당했을 때도 치피는 검과 갑옷을 버리지 않았어요!","source_cn":"上次在斯托密海峡遭遇海难的时候，满满就是穿着它们沉到海里的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C30596988921140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1341123006:1":{"text":"크흠, 사실... 그렇게까지 고집부릴 필요는 없어... 생명이 가장 중요한 거니까, 맞지?","source_cn":"咳，其实……也不必这么坚持……生命第一位，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x341F5E450749774D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}